OL,3,GNEWSASocial security pause 'to help
OL,4,Aworking households'
OL,5,
OL,6,FReduced social security contributions
OL,7,Ffor employees and the self-employed
OL,8,F"will improve the finances for every
OL,9,Fworking household", a deputy has said.
OL,11,FIn 2027, employee contribution rates in
OL,12,FGuernsey will remain at 7.1%, instead
OL,13,Fof the planned rise to 7.6%.
OL,15,FSimilarly, self-employed people in the
OL,16,Fisland will pay 12.1% instead of 12.6%,
OL,17,Fafter an amendment put a pause on
OL,18,Fincreases for the next calendar year.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
