OL,3,GNEWSASocial security pause 'to help
OL,4,Aworking households'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe amendment to the Social Insurance
OL,7,F(Rates of Contributions and Benefits,
OL,8,Fetc.) Ordinance 2026 was proposed by
OL,9,FGavin St Pier and Tom Rylatt. St Pier
OL,10,Fsaid it would help people deal with the
OL,11,Fcost of living.
